      "scope": "package",
      "basis": "GE JVM3160RF/EF spec sheet (docs/reference/jvm3160rfss-spec.pdf) p. 2: \"The hood exhaust has been designed to mate with a standard 3-1/4\" x 10\" rectangular duct. If a round duct is required, a rectangular-to-round transition adaptor must be used. Do not use less than a 6\" diameter duct\". Round 97: an over-the-range microwave's duct is its own, not the airflow band's."
    },
